text.paragraph:
The dose of cefixime should be adjusted in patients with renal impairment as well as those undergoing continuous ambulatory peritoneal dialysis (CAPD) and hemodialysis (HD). Patients on dialysis should be monitored carefully [see 

                              Dosage and Administration (2.3)

                           ].


Cefixime is a semisynthetic cephalosporin antibacterial drug [see 

                              Microbiology (12.4)

                           ].
